# Headers for files the asset store serves without the Worker (styles, scripts, brand
# SVGs, fonts, and /404 when asked for by name). The Worker sets the security headers of
# docs/reference/tau-universe.md §2 on `/`, `/universe`, the 404 answers and the API
# itself (src/pages.ts); keep the policy below identical to CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY there.
#
# The page policy goes on HTML only: an SVG loaded as an image keeps its own <style>
# (the hero's motion), which a `style-src 'self'` on the SVG response could block.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/404
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/app/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/brand/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
